Recommends: stom-pi-modhost
Description: Web UI / HMI server for Rustyfoot (stom-pi)
 mod-ui is the webserver that delivers the HTML5 pedalboard editor and
 talks to the stom-pi audio host (mod-host) over its socket. This package
 ships the UI under /usr/share/stom-pi/, a self-contained Python venv with
 its pinned third-party dependencies, libmod_utils.so, a launcher script
 (/usr/bin/stom-pi) and a systemd service. User data (pedalboards, plugins,
 settings) lives in /var/lib/stom-pi/
